     "<br><div>Hello,</div><div><br></div><div>I usually use R markdown file to keep my code and results. I went to back to my multi-level path analysis results recently after lavaan update (0.6.16), and found chi-square fit indices has changed. (But there are no significant changes in other parameters).</div><div><br></div><div>Here are old and new one. Anyone knows why it has changed? Is it because of different number of iterations?</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;display:block;padding:9.5px;margin:0px 0px 10px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;display:block;padding:9.5px;margin:0px 0px 10px;line-height:1.42857;word-break:break-all;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;padding:0px;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">## lavaan 0.6.15 ended normally after 179 iterations\r\n## \r\n##   Estimator                                         ML\r\n##   Optimization method                           NLMINB\r\n##   Number of model parameters                        43\r\n##   Number of equality constraints                     1\r\n## \r\n## Model Test User Model:\r\n##                                                       \r\n##   Test statistic                                 0.502\r\n##   Degrees of freedom                                 1\r\n##   P-value (Chi-square)                           0.405\r\n##   Test statistic for each group:\r\n##     0                                            0.664\r\n##     1                                            0.015</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;display:block;padding:9.5px;margin:0px 0px 10px;line-height:1.42857;word-break:break-all;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;padding:0px;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;display:block;padding:9.5px;margin:0px 0px 10px;line-height:1.42857;word-break:break-all;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;padding:0px;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px\">## lavaan 0.6.16 ended normally after 225 iterations\r\n## \r\n##   Estimator                                         ML\r\n##   Optimization method                           NLMINB\r\n##   Number of model parameters                        43\r\n##   Number of equality constraints                     1\r\n##                                               \r\n## \r\n## Model Test User Model:\r\n##                                                       \r\n##   Test statistic                                 0.000\r\n##   Degrees of freedom                                 1\r\n##   P-value (Chi-square)                           1.000\r\n##   Test statistic for each group:\r\n##     0                                            0.000\r\n##     1                                            0.000</span></span></span></span></span></div>"
